==Description==
The '''Sunset Nametag''' is a {{Color|Rare}} nametag that can be bought in the daily nametag store for {{Coins|2,000}}.

The '''Sunset Nametag''' has text which has gradient that starts from a luminous, golden shade and gradually transitions to a vibrant, rosy hue as it extends from left to right. It also has a black outline.

